<title>USA: Koo Koo Roo retains investment banker.</title>
<headline>Koo Koo Roo retains investment banker.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Koo Koo Roo Inc said Wednesday it had retained F.M. Roberts &amp; Co, a Los Angeles investment banking firm, to provide advice on financing strategies and mergers and acquisitions.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
